            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Callback fonksiyonuyla ve <code>1000</code> milisaniyelik bir gecikmeyle <code>setTimeout()</code> fonksiyonunu çağır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>setTimeout</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Callback fonksiyonu ve <code>200</code> milisaniyelik gecikmeyle <code>setInterval()</code> metodunu çağır. Sonucunu <code>intervalID</code> değişkenine kaydet.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>setInterval</code>, ardından <code>ourCallback</code> ve son olarak <code>200</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
